## Summary

Reconciles README, product truth, contributor reader, root agent rules, Copilot instructions, agent knowledge/skills/best practices and durable memory with the repository state on 2026-08-03.

## Key changes

- adds a revision-bound current-state snapshot;
- removes obsolete issue #500–#505 route guidance;
- removes direct container hotpatch and in-container package installation instructions;
- removes fixed infrastructure identifiers and unsafe SSH/token examples;
- distinguishes repository, CI, artifact, deployment and runtime truth;
- documents current Repository Intelligence, Continuity and immutable rollout boundaries;
- marks Issue #1182 work as planned rather than implemented;
- removes three transient memory notes that had become stale;
- appends the full path set to both byte-identical Continuity ledgers.

## Evidence boundary

Documentation-only change. No product code, provider configuration, migration, image, deployment or runtime state is changed.

Base revision: `63ddbdf4ed8cd6fa895147e6b09dc39bb2330483`

The PR remains Draft until exact-head Continuity, secret, documentation and required release checks are terminal and reviewed.
